  "notes": "Dawes County (State Auditor), cash basis, FY ended June 30, 2024. Statement p4 Total Governmental Funds column; beginning/ending are cash basis fund balances. ending_investments 552,807 (p3) is informational and already inside ending cash. Balance sheet: Statement of Cash Basis Assets and Fund Balances - Governmental Funds (p3) Total column; totals equal the p1 Statement of Net Position. Detail: General Fund budget schedule (p5-6), Taxes 4,448,600 split using the p4 General Fund column (budget 4,205,890 is for the whole line, so budget_final null on the pieces); major funds Road, Inheritance, Highway Bridge Buyback (p7-8); nonmajor funds via Total Nonmajor Funds column of the combining statement (p12-14) since there are 14 funds; per-fund nonmajor budget schedules (p9-11) not recorded to avoid double counting. Inheritance and Highway Bridge Buyback funds had no disbursements; Road Fund had no transfers out. Read pages 1-14 of 14"
}
